From f2242e2fa660e3e07679af3f573701bbc57fe745 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Graham <scott.github@h4ck3r.net>
Date: Wed, 25 Feb 2026 15:23:43 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] Add experimental jit on Apple arm64

With `-f jit` (or more usefully in sqbe) assembles directly to memory
and runs rather than emitting a .s or .o.
